---
title: Executed-output visibility
---

A document a headless agent runs `taliesin read --run` against to confirm its cells
actually produced output: a labelled figure, a printed stream, and a cell error.

```{python}
#| label: fig-hist
#| fig-cap: A histogram of sampled scores
import matplotlib
matplotlib.use("Agg")
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
plt.hist([1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 5])
plt.gca()
```

